{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Population&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Population\",\"pageid\":117,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>Population is a mechanic introduced in Update 1.6.0 and is a way of determining the development of the region.\\n</p><p><br />\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Population_Calculation\\\">Population Calculation</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Population&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Population Calculation\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>There is no current formula, however based on several tests, the best-known formula is Population=land*25,000, with a 3% margin. This helps large regions grow more, but only if everyone contributes the maximum land to the region.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Population_Uses\\\">Population Uses</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Population&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Population Uses\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>It seems to be tied to the <a href=\\\"/index.php/Retail_store\\\" title=\\\"Retail store\\\"> Retail store's</a> demand calculation, however, there is no info on the exact calculation.\\n</p>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261008185319\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\\n-->\\n<!--\\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:117-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008185319 and revision id 482\\n -->\\n</div>\",\"categories\":[],\"links\":[{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Retail store\",\"exists\":true}],\"templates\":[],\"images\":[]}}"}